        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nEmail enquiries only please - Exceptional, apartment presented in superb condition throughout. \nNo expense has being spared by the owners with the exceptional quality and high specification of the fixtures and fittings, comprising of open plan sitting/dining/kitchen area, double bedroom with sliding wardrobes, bathroom and outside storage space.\nThe residence is positioned at the end of a private enclave and is approached through secure electric entrance gates guaranteeing privacy for its occupants. Prosperous is a fabulous setting with an array of excellent amenities and services including shops, schools, church, cafes, restaurants, crèches and a wide range of sporting and recreational facilities. Dublin city and its surrounding areas (just 45 minutes away) are easily accessible via a frequent bus service, commuter rail links at Sallins and Maynooth and easy access to both the M4 and M7 motorways."
